plify, recolor, or rebrand the box. SET & PROPS: Home dining table at night: warm pendant light, a laptop, a desk calendar turned to the last month of the year with dates crossed out (no readable text), stacks of office folders brought home, a cup of tea, dim living room behind. TIMELINE — 10 seconds: 0–2s Hook · close-up: her finger slides along crossed-out dates on a desk calendar (no readable text); cut to medium shot as she looks up at the camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Akhir tahun tinggal sebentar lagi." Delivery (EN): quiet, tense 2–4s Problem · medium shot, she gestures at a stack of office folders on the table. VO (ID, verbatim): "Rekap kinerja klaster belum mulai." Delivery (EN): honest 4–6s Problem · medium close-up, she pushes her reading glasses up. VO (ID, verbatim): "Datanya masih di tiap PJ." Delivery (EN): tired, worried 6–8s Problem · medium shot, she glances at the dim living room, then the lens. VO (ID, verbatim): "Lagi-lagi kerja sampai malam." Delivery (EN): soft, rueful 8–10s Beat · medium shot, she closes the laptop halfway and sighs. VO: none. AUDIO: Quiet night home ambience, clock ticking, pages turning. Only the talent speaks. Natural Indonesian, conversational, clear pronunciation, no background music. Lighting/mood: realistic natural light matching the set, clean soft contrast, believable Indonesian setting, not glossy, not studio. Camera: follow the camera style above consistently; stable and restrained, no whip pans, no drone, no 360 orbit. Keep product readable whenever it is on screen. Performance: natural facial expression, believable professional UGC, natural eye contact, restrained gestures, no exaggerated acting. Lips clearly synced to each word. Hands: simple, natural, relaxed movements. CLEAN OUTPUT: No subtitles, captions, generated text overlays, watermark, poster layout, storyboard panels, or added graphics. Do not invent product details, claims, prices, ratings, testimonials, certifications, or guarantees. Keep exact talent face, the WARDROBE above, product shape, colors, packaging, box title, emblem, document folders, laptop screen content, and visual details consistent with the DNA references.